  "id": "molasses-cake",
  "name": "Molasses Cake",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced cake made with molasses and coffee",
  "description": "This tender American cake combines brown sugar, molasses, warming spices, and brewed coffee for a rich, aromatic dessert.",
